<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Aligned with the development of the Karbala Refinery—a facility designed to process 140,000 barrels per day of heavy, high-sulfur fuel oil (HSFO)—the Iraqi Ministry of Oil launched plans for a thermal power plant to utilize this fuel. The Al Khairat Thermal Power Plant, strategically located near the refinery, will supply electricity to the national grid while also providing a sustainable energy source for refinery operations, ensuring efficient and reliable power production.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->
